h=00_AQKOiYLBbzH5Brnsaze7X59bR-YkXdD5iwUotimyTt0X-w&oe=6AAFE964"}, {"file_name": "s3.png", "id": "27598478763164402", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623565_27598478766497735_7172931464418295918_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=olio6YvsdrgQ7kNvwHx-6lU&_nc_oc=Adpk2Ti-18KNM3LYANlBoyXDieU1ZYMLtpW8vskfgeoAD3Aqhel_-J1K8wPBPy6C-is&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK6IvpGVq3Xbew4QZn5vDxz0GpJxlCjUvLASAjTZEDQ7A&oe=6AAFF5A2"}, {"file_name": "s4.png", "id": "1386180180309827", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620316_1386180183643160_806940499244554692_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HzMQMPWRQgoQ7kNvwE86KuM&_nc_oc=AdpItwc1gXf8KVsd-J_D7KWqO9FQYSl3wJJdxz_oredO7FxGaUIQCNitfiGpLaa27A8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJM2MeR5oTZQHfZprQs95mZCcQYphfY-7Z98mvMK2bwLw&oe=6AB00288"}, {"file_name": "s5.png", "id": "1606231204345103", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593942860_1606231207678436_4288968465108539005_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CmWgJeeFR1QQ7kNvwG5DhSl&_nc_oc=Adqum2lLQjrRprq2JiKx52-IPRCW-iNHBXkFz7ppXiBJ47wxbsS8vvnQ6VzBtxHhQk8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK4JfdPEfNWr_y8dN8ZYaMo3Xk3uY-WOQpBIushKSwNbg&oe=6AAFDA55"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "star_cover.png", "id": "28725425130416810", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623512_28725425140416809_5513349611134248212_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rn8qmbwjFzEQ7kNvwEoStcQ&_nc_oc=AdowNxTEYsGQZ0w4y4bw-wjVk48IxAdrM88AIFwGZJ1IHC7YZnHBrDwxY1ZTE5idOYM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKznI5u-8OkIxjOt3UZkIB0Kgqwp9-2O8pKzSVD-JdX7Q&oe=6AAFE000"}, "display_name": "Zen Stargazer", "keywords": ["astronomy", "stargazing", "stars", "planets", "constellations"], "long_description": "Zen Stargazer is a mixed-reality stargazing experience for Meta Quest. Your room stays real; the sky above follows your chosen time and location.\n\nPOINT TO LEARN\nAim the right controller at the sky to identify stars, planets, nebulae, and galaxies\u2014with short educational notes for bright landmarks.\n\nTIME & PLACE\nFollow live \u201cnow,\u201d or lock a custom observing time. Pick a city on the world map and the sky updates instantly\u2014great for rehearsing a meteor peak or revisiting an eclipse night.\n\nCONSTELLATIONS & DEEP SKY\nToggle constellation lines, the ecliptic, and selected deep-sky objects. Some targets include public-domain astronomy imagery for context.\n\nPLANETS & MOON\nExplore planet phases and moon illumination with a telescope-style view. Jump chips help you hop to previous or next related sky events.\n\nMETEOR SHOWERS & EVENT BOOK\nBrowse classic showers and key sky events. Shower notes explain what you\u2019ll see\u2014and that most showers are dust from a parent body (often a comet) entering Earth\u2019s atmosphere.\n\nPASSTHROUGH & FULL SKY\nUse the left stick to adjust how much real-world passthrough is revealed under the virtual sky; push further for a full-sphere / space view. Export a 360\u00b0 sky still to share.\n\nLANGUAGES\nUI and core content support Traditional Chinese, English, and Japanese\u2014switch anytime from the info pad.\n\nUse in a clear guardian boundary. Zen Stargazer is for learning and wonder; ephemerides are educational approximations\u2014not a substitute for professional almanacs.", "short_description": "Look up in mixed reality on Meta Quest. Point to learn stars, planets, and deep-sky objects. Scrub time, choose your observing site, follow meteor showers and eclipses. A left-hand info pad keeps the sky in reach\u2014\u7e41\u4e2d / English / \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e."}]}, "developer_name": "Zen Chang", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.zenchang.com/2026/09/privacy-policy-zen-stargazer.html", "developer_terms_of